    "text": "hoodline.com\nwebsite\nCary\nCary Woman Strikes $1 Million Jackpot with Chance Lottery Ticket at Jewel-Osco\nBy Richard M. Sullivan,\n7 hours agoIn a twist of fate that surpassed her wildest dreams, a Cary woman's spur-of-the-moment decision to purchase a different lottery ticket than initially intended brought her a windfall of $1 million. The Illinois Lottery shared that the winner, who opted for anonymity and dubbed herself \"Wishing Fish,\" had chosen a $10 Ultimate Bonus Payout ticket at a local Jewel-Osco and struck gold. According to ABC 7 Chicago, the fortuitous ticket caught her eye as she deliberated her options, standing out as the one for her.\n7",
